getReferencePrice.t.sol
├── given no feed route is registered for the provided base token
│  └── it should revert with PriceFeedRouteNotRegistered
└── given a feed route is registered for the provided base token
   ├── given one of the feed prices is negative
   │  └── it should revert with NegativeTokenPrice
   └── given all feed prices are non-negative
      ├── given one of the feed prices is older than its staleness threshold
      │  └── it should revert with PriceFeedStale
      └── given none of the feed prices is older than its staleness threshold
         └── it should return the price of the base token denominated in the reference currency, aggregated over its feed route
